 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "datapoints lists objects {\"tags\": [strings], \"timestamp\": integer, \"value\": integer} in strictly increasing timestamp order; tag is a string and k a positive integer. Only datapoints whose tags contain tag take part. For each such datapoint, in order, compute the sum of the values of the participating datapoints whose timestamp lies in [t - k + 1, t], where t is its own timestamp. Return the list of sums.",
